Two optional fields the lens would copy into required ones with no fallback:
one diagnostic at the lens, whose help writes a fallback for both, with a
note where the target requires each.
-- ship/history/0.0.thema --
Schema: {
	id:    string
	owner?: string
	team?:  string
}
-- ship/history/1.0.thema --
Schema: {
	id:    string
	owner: string
	team:  string
}

ForwardLens: {
	v0_0: _
	v1_0: {
		id: v0_0.id
	}
}
-- ship/tip.thema --
Schema: {
	id:    string
	owner: string
	team:  string
}
-- out/error --
error[E0343]: owner and team are optional in v0.0 and required in v1.0
 --> history/1.0.thema:7:1
  |
3 |     owner: string
  |     ----- v1.0 requires owner
4 |     team:  string
  |     ---- v1.0 requires team
...
7 | ForwardLens: {
  | ^^^^^^^^^^^
  |
  = help: write owner: _coalesce(v0_0.owner, <fallback>), team: _coalesce(v0_0.team, <fallback>) to say what to use when they are absent
